# Runtime data & secrets (created on first run)
# NOTE: ignore the SQLite file only — the folder name `data/` must NOT be ignored
# as a directory, or it silently swallows the source folder `Data/` on Windows
# (case-insensitive matching) and the database/entity layer never gets committed.
